  "notes": "Experiment-only feature (intent: 'no plans to ship it as is'; no spec, TAG N/A). Every contract is anchored to the explainer plus four Chromium source files fetched live 2026-07-29. Known source divergence, documented on-page: explainer delay clamp is 0-5000 while the implementation enforces a 10 ms floor 'per privacy review' (anchor_element_interaction_tracker.cc); implementation treated as authoritative. The chromestatus detail record's browsers.chrome.status still reads 'Proposed' with empty OT fields while the milestone=152 listing files the feature as Origin trial \u2014 listing treated as authoritative per invariant #2 and the discrepancy disclosed in at-a-glance. Runtime behavior is source-derived, not executed (needs Android + OT token / --enable-blink-features)."
